 proxmod (>= 0.1.0),
Description: token-authorised storage ops for proxmox-csi-plugin
 A proxmod extension providing a cross-storage volume copy REST endpoint
 under /nodes/{node}/proxmod/csi-storage, used by proxmox-csi-plugin's
 migration controller and volume snapshots. It is gated by an explicit ACL
 check instead of PVE's root@pam-only default, so proxmox-csi-plugin can
 use a scoped API token instead of root credentials.
 .
 Supersedes the hack/pve-token-copy systemd-wrapper workaround shipped
 directly in proxmox-csi-plugin, which predates proxmod.
